  "description": "<p>HTTP <tt>Prefer:</tt> header <tt>omits</tt> and <tt>includes</tt> do not function on the <tt>fcr:versions</tt> endpoint as they do on plain resource endpoints.</p>\n\n<p>Example <tt>PreferContainment</tt> results on resource (works):</p>\n<div class=\"code panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent\">\n<pre class=\"code-java\">\r\n$ curl -H <span class=\"code-quote\">\"Accept: application/rdf+xml\"</span> -H <span class=\"code-quote\">\"Prefer: <span class=\"code-keyword\">return</span>=representation; omit=\\\"</span>http:<span class=\"code-comment\">//www.w3.org/ns/ldp#PreferMinimalContainer\\<span class=\"code-quote\">\"; include=\\\"</span>http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#PreferContainment\\<span class=\"code-quote\">\"\" \"</span>http://localhost:8080/<span class=\"code-keyword\">rest</span>/myresource\"</span>\r\n</pre>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"preformatted panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"preformattedContent panelContent\">\n<pre>&lt;rdf:RDF\r\n    xmlns:rdf=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#\"\r\n    xmlns:ldp=\"http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#\" &gt; \r\n  &lt;rdf:Description rdf:about=\"http://localhost:8080/rest/myresource\"&gt;\r\n    &lt;ldp:contains rdf:resource=\"http://localhost:8080/rest/myresource/TECH0\"/&gt;\r\n    &lt;ldp:contains rdf:resource=\"http://localhost:8080/rest/myresource/RELS-INT\"/&gt;\r\n    &lt;ldp:contains rdf:resource=\"http://localhost:8080/rest/myresource/RELS-EXT\"/&gt;\r\n    &lt;ldp:contains rdf:resource=\"http://localhost:8080/rest/myresource/MASTER0\"/&gt;\r\n    &lt;ldp:contains rdf:resource=\"http://localhost:8080/rest/myresource/DC\"/&gt;\r\n    &lt;ldp:contains rdf:resource=\"http://localhost:8080/rest/myresource/AUDIT\"/&gt;\r\n    &lt;ldp:contains rdf:resource=\"http://localhost:8080/rest/myresource/ADMINMD\"/&gt;\r\n  &lt;/rdf:Description&gt;\r\n&lt;/rdf:RDF&gt;</pre>\n</div></div>\n<p> Example <tt>PreferContainment</tt> results on resource versions (does not return results):</p>\n<div class=\"code panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent\">\n<pre class=\"code-java\">\r\ncurl -H <span class=\"code-quote\">\"Accept: application/rdf+xml\"</span> -H<span class=\"code-quote\">\"Prefer: <span class=\"code-keyword\">return</span>=representation; omit=\\\"</span>http:<span class=\"code-comment\">//www.w3.org/ns/ldp#PreferMinimalContainer\\<span class=\"code-quote\">\"; include=\\\"</span>http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#PreferContainment\\<span class=\"code-quote\">\"\" \"</span>http://localhost:8080/<span class=\"code-keyword\">rest</span>/myresource/fcr:versions\"</span></pre>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"code panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent\">\n<pre class=\"code-java\">\r\n&lt;rdf:RDF\r\n    xmlns:rdf=<span class=\"code-quote\">\"http:<span class=\"code-comment\">//www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#\"</span> &gt; \r\n</span>&lt;/rdf:RDF&gt;\r\n</pre>\n</div></div>",
